# Questionnaire – Question 1

## Goal
Generate fake GenAI news content for Question 1 of the thesis questionnaire Part 1.

## Tool 
ChatGPT+

## Prompt
```text
Can you make a text about something AI related with students to make it kind of relevant. It has to be in English and on the easy side to spot 
that it is not something real. You can use the Universiteit van Amsterdam as an example. For all the coming prompts, the text 
does not have to be very long. 
```
## Output

A University of Amsterdam is testing an artificial intelligence system that can reportedly predict students’ 
exam scores before they take their final tests. The AI analyzes attendance, online activity, and participation during lectures. 
Supporters believe the system could help students who need extra support earlier in the semester. Critics, however, are concerned 
about privacy and the reliability of the predictions. The university says the technology is still being tested and no final decisions 
have been made yet.

